        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Zaulo, ringhmei nthuk pui zei,",
            "Ntau hei ni luang bam;",
            "Mikdui keilou mei Pu zei tei,",
            "Gunh kumna ‘phuanpui tuang. [2]",
            "",
            "Gunh kumna phuan pui bam khou louna,",
            "Thou puni lou nimei guay tei;",
            "Paap guay khiu thanlouni.",
            "",
            "2. Kanloumei Pu Kalvary khou,",
            "Ryanra rainriu khaenglou",
            "Khou rui nthukpui zei patlou,",
            "Gunh kumna ‘phuanpui tuang. [2]",
            "",
            "3. He! Meigeih mei tan uh puni,",
            "Hei zei hei luang bam khou,",
            "Nthuk pui Na ta ningmei rui,",
            "Gunh kumna ‘phuan puni. [2]",
            "",
            "4. Poubaomei tei keidat puni,",
            "Kamei nunta laakhang,",
            "Nthuk pui zei ningmei na rui,",
            "Tingkao ram lapuni. [2]"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
